---
import { Mail, MessageCircle, Phone } from "@lucide/astro";
import { blogIndex } from "@/lib/site-data";
---

<footer class="bg-brand text-white [&_a]:focus-visible:outline-white">
  <div class="container-wide pt-16 pb-8 sm:pt-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-6">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center font-readout text-[clamp(2.25rem,1.6rem+2.6vw,3.5rem)] leading-none font-extrabold tracking-[0.02em] text-white uppercase"
          >AI Studio TH</a
        >
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-base text-on-brand-2">
          AI rig บนโต๊ะสำหรับ developer, researcher และทีมเทคนิคเล็กที่ต้องการรัน
          model ในเครื่อง.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-t border-white/30 pt-6 md:col-span-3 md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pt-0 md:pl-8"
      >
        <h2 class="text-legend font-semibold text-white">สำรวจ</h2>
        <div class="mt-2 grid justify-items-start text-base text-white">
          <a href="/blog" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center">{blogIndex.navLabel}</a>
          <a href="/builds" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center">Builds</a>
          <a href="/models" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center">Models</a>
          <a href="/benchmarks" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center">Benchmarks</a>
          <a href="/about" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center">About</a>
          <a href="/ecosystem" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center">Ecosystem</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center">Contact</a>
          <a href="/privacy" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center">นโยบายความเป็นส่วนตัว</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-t border-white/30 pt-6 md:col-span-3 md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pt-0 md:pl-8"
      >
        <h2 class="text-legend font-semibold text-white">ติดต่อ</h2>
        <div class="mt-2 grid justify-items-start text-base text-white">
          <a data-cta="email" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2">
            <Mail size={15} />
          </a>
          <a data-cta="tel" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2">
            <Phone size={15} />
          </a>
          <a data-cta="line" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2">
            <MessageCircle size={15} />LINE Official
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-14 border-t border-white/30 pt-6 text-sm text-on-brand-2">
      © {new Date().getFullYear()} AI Studio TH
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
